{"id":"497174","name":"萝卜牛腩汤","author":"髅小彬","authorId":"11861627","desc":"","cover":"images/497174/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"白萝卜","amount":"1根"},{"name":"牛腩","amount":"500g"}],"sub":[{"name":"料酒","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"姜","amount":"3片"},{"name":"小葱","amount":"3根"},{"name":"八角","amount":"1颗"},{"name":"桂皮","amount":"1块"},{"name":"香叶","amount":"1片"},{"name":"三奈","amount":"6颗"},{"name":"花椒粒","amount":"1匙"},{"name":"干红辣椒","amount":"2根"},{"name":"盐","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"枸杞","amount":"1勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"白萝卜去皮切块","img":"images/497174/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"牛腩切块","img":"images/497174/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"牛腩冷水入锅，加入料酒焯出血水","img":"images/497174/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"牛腩捞出放入砂锅中，加入姜片，葱段，八角，桂皮，香叶，三奈，花椒粒和干红辣椒","img":"images/497174/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入适量热水，煮开后转小火煮1小时","img":"images/497174/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入白萝卜继续煮50分钟","img":"images/497174/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入盐和枸杞，煮10分钟即可。","img":"images/497174/step_7.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：砂锅、煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}